[statement]
A checksum of the sum's six digits, a NUL and a digit, after another
member. Every reader reads the header. ferrotape refuses the archive:
after its digits a checksum holds spaces and NULs alone, as any other
numeric field does.

[archive]
header name=first
data "1\n"
header name=odd checksum="######\x000"
header name=after
end

[verdict]
all: refused Checksum at 1024

